  "description": "Create adorable spring-themed artwork in seconds with this 12-piece Spring Procreate Stamp Brush Set, perfect for Easter designs, Mother’s Day crafts, children’s illustrations, and seasonal digital projects.\nDesigned especially for Procreate on iPad, this collection includes cute hand-drawn stamps featuring animals, flowers, and nature elements that instantly bring charm and personality to your artwork. Simply tap to stamp — no drawing skills required!\nThis set also includes a FREE coordinated colour palette, making it easy to create cohesive spring artwork, greeting cards, stickers, and printable designs.\nPerfect for illustrators, small business owners, teachers, planners, and digital creators looking to quickly design seasonal graphics.\nWhether you’re creating Easter cards, nursery prints, sublimation designs, or social media graphics, these stamps help you design faster while keeping a consistent cute aesthetic.\n⸻\n✨ What You Can Make With This Set\n\t•\tEaster cards & invitations\n\t•\tMother’s Day greeting cards\n\t•\tPrintable wall art & nursery decor\n\t•\tStickers & sticker sheets\n\t•\tSublimation designs\n\t•\tKids activity pages & colouring sheets\n\t•\tDigital planners & journaling pages\n\t•\tScrapbooking elements\n\t•\tCricut & Silhouette projects\n\t•\tSocial media graphics\n\t•\tSpring-themed branding visuals\n\t•\tClassroom worksheets & learning materials\n⸻\n📦 What’s Included\n\t•\t12 Procreate Stamp Brushes (.brushset)\n\t•\tFREE Spring Colour Palette (.swatches)\n\t•\tHigh-quality clean line artwork\n\t•\tInstant digital download\n\t•\tCompatible with Procreate (iPad only)\n⸻\n🖼️ List of Stamps Included (Items in Image)\n\t1.\tSun\n\t2.\tBunny / Rabbit\n\t3.\tPig\n\t4.\tSnail\n\t5.\tLadybug\n\t6.\tDaisy Flower\n\t7.\tMushroom\n\t8.\tDuck\n\t9.\tSheep / Lamb\n\t10.\tDuckling\n\t11.\tButterfly\n\t12.\tWooden Fence\n⸻\n💻 Requirements\n\t•\tiPad\n\t•\tApple Pencil (recommended)\n\t•\tProcreate App (latest version)\nNot compatible with Photoshop, Illustrator, or other apps.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Create adorable spring-themed artwork in seconds with this 12-piece Spring Procreate Stamp Brush Set, perfect for Easter designs, Mother’s Day crafts, children’s illustrations, and seasonal digital projects.</p>\n<p>Designed especially for Procreate on iPad, this collection includes cute hand-drawn stamps featuring animals, flowers, and nature elements that instantly bring charm and personality to your artwork. Simply tap to stamp — no drawing skills required!</p>\n<p>This set also includes a FREE coordinated colour palette, making it easy to create cohesive spring artwork, greeting cards, stickers, and printable designs.</p>\n<p>Perfect for illustrators, small business owners, teachers, planners, and digital creators looking to quickly design seasonal graphics.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating Easter cards, nursery prints, sublimation designs, or social media graphics, these stamps help you design faster while keeping a consistent cute aesthetic.</p>\n<p>⸻</p>\n<p>✨ What You Can Make With This Set<br>\n\t•\tEaster cards &amp; invitations<br>\n\t•\tMother’s Day greeting cards<br>\n\t•\tPrintable wall art &amp; nursery decor<br>\n\t•\tStickers &amp; sticker sheets<br>\n\t•\tSublimation designs<br>\n\t•\tKids activity pages &amp; colouring sheets<br>\n\t•\tDigital planners &amp; journaling pages<br>\n\t•\tScrapbooking elements<br>\n\t•\tCricut &amp; Silhouette projects<br>\n\t•\tSocial media graphics<br>\n\t•\tSpring-themed branding visuals<br>\n\t•\tClassroom worksheets &amp; learning materials</p>\n<p>⸻</p>\n<p>📦 What’s Included<br>\n\t•\t12 Procreate Stamp Brushes (.brushset)<br>\n\t•\tFREE Spring Colour Palette (.swatches)<br>\n\t•\tHigh-quality clean line artwork<br>\n\t•\tInstant digital download<br>\n\t•\tCompatible with Procreate (iPad only)</p>\n<p>⸻</p>\n<p>🖼️ List of Stamps Included (Items in Image)<br>\n\t1.\tSun<br>\n\t2.\tBunny / Rabbit<br>\n\t3.\tPig<br>\n\t4.\tSnail<br>\n\t5.\tLadybug<br>\n\t6.\tDaisy Flower<br>\n\t7.\tMushroom<br>\n\t8.\tDuck<br>\n\t9.\tSheep / Lamb<br>\n\t10.\tDuckling<br>\n\t11.\tButterfly<br>\n\t12.\tWooden Fence</p>\n<p>⸻</p>\n<p>💻 Requirements<br>\n\t•\tiPad<br>\n\t•\tApple Pencil (recommended)<br>\n\t•\tProcreate App (latest version)</p>\n<p>Not compatible with Photoshop, Illustrator, or other apps.</p>",
